<title>MEXICO: Mexico livestock report, feeder export price - USDA.</title>
<headline>Mexico livestock report, feeder export price - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported Wednesday that no head were exported into the United States Friday because of the national holiday for Easter.</p>
<p>E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
